From e979c904092480ed087ba7aec90a391126b66f5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:13:58 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(post): Siemens Sinumerik 810M post and EMCO VMC-200
 machine

Clean-room Siemens Sinumerik 810M 3-axis milling post (%MPF, ()
comments, G71 mm, G54-G57, L81-L89 R-parameter cycles, G2/G3 I/J/K,
N9999 and 120-char guards), EMCO VMC-200 machine file, conformance
goldens, script suite, and owner air-cut kit.

Fixes #2888
